==== System Information ====
Show ATI Information ;ATI
Show IMSI Number ;AT+CIMI
Check Current IMEI ;AT+CGSN
Check Phone Number ;AT+CNUM
Show Firmware Version ;AT+QGMR
Show Hardware Revision ;AT+QHWREV
Show SIM Status ;AT+CPIN?
Show Temperature ;AT+QTEMP
Show Module Model ;AT+GMM
Show Manufacturer ;AT+GMI

==== Signal & Cell Information ====
Basic Signal Strength ;AT+CSQ
Serving + Neighbour Cells ;AT+QENG="neighbourcell"
Serving Cell Info (NR/LTE) ;AT+QENG="servingcell"
Show Network Information ;AT+QNWINFO
Show CA Status ;AT+QCAINFO
Show Current LTE/NR Band ;AT+QBAND?
Show Operator Name ;AT+COPS?

==== Network Mode Selection ====
Display Current Preferred Mode ;AT+QNWPREFCFG="mode_pref"
Lock to NSA (5G+LTE) ;AT+QNWPREFCFG="mode_pref",NR5G:LTE
Lock to SA Only (5G) ;AT+QNWPREFCFG="mode_pref",NR5G
Lock to LTE Only ;AT+QNWPREFCFG="mode_pref",LTE
Enable Automatic Mode Selection ;AT+QNWPREFCFG="mode_pref",AUTO

==== USB Interface Mode ====
Check Current USB Mode ;AT+QCFG="usbnet"
Use QMI Mode ;AT+QCFG="usbnet",0
Use ECM Mode ;AT+QCFG="usbnet",1
Use MBIM Mode ;AT+QCFG="usbnet",2
Use RNDIS Mode ;AT+QCFG="usbnet",3

==== Module Power Control ====
Turn Off Modem ;AT+CFUN=0
Turn On Modem ;AT+CFUN=1
Restart Modem (Normal) ;AT+CFUN=1,1
Restart Modem (Full Reset) ;AT+RESET
Enable Airplane Mode ;AT+CFUN=4

==== Temporary (reset after reboot) ====
Show PCI Lock Options ;AT+QNWLOCK=?
Lock 4G PCI ;AT+QNWLOCK="common/4g",1,<earfcn>,<pci>
Remove 4G PCI Lock ;AT+QNWLOCK="common/4g",0
Lock 5G PCI (SA) ;AT+QNWLOCK="common/5g",<pci>,<arfcn>,<scs>,<band>
Remove 5G PCI Lock (SA) ;AT+QNWLOCK="common/5g",0

==== Permanent (saved across reboot) ====
Save Current PCI Lock ;AT+QNWLOCK="save_ctrl",1,1
Reset PCI Lock ;AT+QNWLOCK="save_ctrl",1,0

==== Band Locking ====
Show Supported Bands ;AT+QNWPREFCFG="policy_band"
Lock LTE Bands ;AT+QNWPREFCFG="lte_band",<bandmask>
Lock NR5G Bands ;AT+QNWPREFCFG="nr5g_band",<bandmask>
Clear LTE Band Locks ;AT+QNWPREFCFG="lte_band",0
Clear NR5G Band Locks ;AT+QNWPREFCFG="nr5g_band",0

==== IMS / VoLTE ====
Enable VoLTE ;AT+QCFG="ims",1
Disable VoLTE ;AT+QCFG="ims",0
Check VoLTE State ;AT+QCFG="ims"
Enable NR5G SA Capability ;AT+QNWPREFCFG="nsa_nr5g_pref",1
Disable NR5G SA Capability ;AT+QNWPREFCFG="nsa_nr5g_pref",0

==== APN & Data ====
Show APN Profiles ;AT+CGDCONT?
Set Auto APN ;AT+CGDCONT=1,"IP",""
Show PDP Context State ;AT+CGACT?
Activate Data Context ;AT+CGACT=1,1
Deactivate Data Context ;AT+CGACT=0,1

==== SIM & Network Registration ====
Check Registration Status ;AT+CREG?
Check EPS/4G Registration ;AT+CEREG?
Check 5G Registration ;AT+QREGSWT?
Force Manual Operator Select ;AT+COPS=1,2,"<MCCMNC>"
Back to Automatic Operator ;AT+COPS=0

==== SMS ====
Set SMS to Text Mode ;AT+CMGF=1
Set SMS to PDU Mode ;AT+CMGF=0
Check SMS Mode ;AT+CSMS?
List All SMS ;AT+CMGL="ALL"

==== Diagnostic & Debug ====
Show Log Configuration ;AT+QLOGCFG?
Show Task/Thread Status ;AT+QTASK
Show Runtime Errors ;AT+QERR

==== Repair & Troubleshoot ====
Reset Radio Stack ;AT+CFUN=1,1
Reset Network Registration ;AT+CRESET
Clear All Network Settings ;AT+QPRTPARA=3
Check SIM Voltage ;AT+QSIMVOL

==== IMEI / Calibration ====
Change IMEI ;AT+EGMR=1,7,"IMEI_NUMBER"
Read Original IMEI ;AT+EGMR=0,7

